  "label": "9/11 Terrorist Attacks",
  "description": "The 9/11 attacks were a series of coordinated terrorist attacks carried out by the Islamic extremist group al-Qaeda against the United States on September 11, 2001. The attacks resulted in the destruction of the World Trade Center towers in New York City and the deaths of nearly 3,000 people. This event is the central historical reference point for the meme, as the image of the Twin Towers is juxtaposed with text expressing outrage over political choices, implying a connection between the attacks and current political figures or parties.",
